<title>USA: Everest enters into credit facility.</title>
<headline>Everest enters into credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everest Medical Corp said Tuesday it entered into a new credit facility with Riverside Bank of Minneapolis consisting of a $300,000 million line of credit.</p>
<p>&quot;This credit facility will allow the company to more efficiently manage our working capital needs in the future,&quot; said president John Shannon Jr in a statement.</p>
<p>Everest manufactures and markets medical devices for minimally invasive surgery.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
